# Generated lecture media and transcripts
# Keep source media, temporary audio, and other generated data out of Git.
# Raw transcript TXT + JSON files ARE versioned.
data/*
!data/.gitkeep
!data/*/
data/*/*
!data/*/raw_transcript.txt
!data/*/raw_transcript.json